 * FILE:
 * 2-MAIRIX_Schema.gs
 *
 * PURPOSE:
 *
 * 1. Build MAIRIX from an empty spreadsheet.
 * 2. Create all required sheets.
 * 3. Create headers centrally.
 * 4. Create SETTINGS with initial system variables.
 * 5. Define the central User / Employee / Role
 *    / Permission / Warehouse security structure.
 * 6. Prevent modules from depending on legacy layouts.
 *
 * IMPORTANT:
 *
 * - This file creates STRUCTURE only.
 * - No historical / legacy data is imported.
 * - Business transactions are NOT created here.
 * - Runtime settings remain editable through SETTINGS.
 *
 * SECURITY MODEL:
 *
 * EMPLOYEE
 *     |
 *     +---- User ID
 *             |
 *             +---- Role Code
 *             |       |
 *             |       +---- Default Permissions
 *             |
 *             +---- Final User Permissions
 *             |
 *             +---- Warehouse Access
 *             |
 *             +---- Active / Inactive / Blocked
 *
 * SALESMAN
 *     |
 *     +---- Employee Code
 *     +---- User ID
 *
 ************************************************/


